  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Place assumptions",
   "texto": [
    "**In** = in, inside. **Auf** = above. **Unter** = below. **Neben** = next to. **Hinter** = behind. **Vor** = in front of. **Zwischen** = enter."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The Datif: Where is something",
   "texto": [
    "When these prepositions say **dónde está** something, the article goes in **dativo**: **der** and **das** move to **dem**; **die** goes to **der**.",
    "**der Tisch** → **auf dem Tisch** (above the table). **die Tasche** → **in der Tasche** (in the bag). **das Sofa** → **neben dem Sofa** (next to the sofa).",
    "The possessive changes the same: **in deiner Tasche** (in your bag).",
    "**In dem** is contracted to **im**: **im Wohnzimmer**."
   ]
  },
